# Adds a small kerning table to Pico3x5. Pico3x5 ships uppercase letters,
# digits, space, and period, so kern pairs stay within that alphabet.
# Used to regenerate sample/fonts/Pico3x5.gff:
#   java -jar build/glyphforge.jar edit --font sample/fonts/Pico3x5.gff --script sample/scripts/kern-pico3x5.gfs
kern A V -1
kern A W -1
kern A T -1
kern L T -1
kern V A -1
status
quit